<title>UK: London grain fixtures.</title>
<headline>London grain fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Andre TBN - 54,000 tonnes hss USG/Japan $21 no combo fio 11 days shex 15-25/5 Halla.</p>
<p>Sun P - 49,000 tonnes hss Paranagua/Lisbon $13.75 fio 5,000/10,000 16-21/5 Andre.</p>
<p>Wadi Al Arish - 54,000 tonnes hss USG/Japan $21.25 no combo fio 11 days 21-31/5 Cho Yang.</p>
<p>TBN - 8,000 tonnes corn and 3,000 meals USG/Rio Haina $12.50 fio 5,000/3,000 corn plus 1,000 meals 10-20/5 Garnac.</p>
